#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/12-ros2_parameters.md:16
#: e2140dc626764cd0aaf65bb732e745b0
msgid ""
"The `ocs2_arm_controller` README names `config/ocs2_arm_controller.yaml`."
" At [arms_ros2_control `9a1da3ba`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/tree/9a1da3ba3747b3042866422c2269c1d49bb02f48/controller/ocs2_arm_controller/config)"
" that folder only has `demo.rviz`. Machine values are in the description "
"YAML (example: "
"[`cr5_description/.../ros2_controllers.yaml`](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/robot-descriptions-"
"dobot/blob/main/cr5_description/config/ros2_control/ros2_controllers.yaml))."
msgstr ""
"`ocs2_arm_controller` README 写的是 `config/ocs2_arm_controller.yaml`。在 "
"[arms_ros2_control `9a1da3ba`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/tree/9a1da3ba3747b3042866422c2269c1d49bb02f48/controller/ocs2_arm_controller/config)"
" 该目录只有 `demo.rviz`。机型取值在描述包 YAML（例如 "
"[`cr5_description/.../ros2_controllers.yaml`](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/robot-descriptions-"
"dobot/blob/main/cr5_description/config/ros2_control/ros2_controllers.yaml)）。"

