#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/12-ros2_parameters.md:31
#: 4d1b752b030043b1bd6714c493da18f4
msgid ""
"Hardware `<param>` values do **not** appear on `ros2 param list`. They "
"are baked into `/robot_description` when xacro runs. Confirm the plugin "
"with `ros2 control list_hardware_interfaces` and the xacro under "
"`xacro/ros2_control/`."
msgstr ""
"硬件 `<param>` **不会**出现在 `ros2 param list` 上。它们在 xacro 运行时写入 "
"`/robot_description`。用 `ros2 control list_hardware_interfaces` 以及 "
"`xacro/ros2_control/` 下的 xacro 确认插件。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/12-ros2_parameters.md:33
#: 22aa2c639a4a4f488192a64a115da4c5
